1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,600
You?

2
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,040
You're up.

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,080
Mm.

4
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,680
Song Yi.

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,160
What's wrong?

6
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,560
Eat up.

7
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,360
He's Song Yi.

8
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:24,520
Oh.

9
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,839
You got drunk last night

10
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,119
and after I got you home

11
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,520
the drink hit me too

12
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,240
so I fell asleep on the couch.

13
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,920
Then you...

14
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,200
Oh

15
00:00:42,319 --> 00:00:43,319
you mean breakfast?

16
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,480
I was up early

17
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:45,160
so

18
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,160
I just made some.

19
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,520
I remember last night

20
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,920
you didn't say a word

21
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:53,160
I thought you…

22
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,680
Here

23
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,600
let's have breakfast.

24
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,200
Mm.

25
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,400
Eat up.

26
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,480
There was someone once

27
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:55,320
who made me breakfast every day too.

28
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,080
Huh.

29
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:10,920
Is that so?

30
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,439
That person

31
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,720
must've been good to you.

32
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,880
He was good to me.

33
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,160
So good that...

34
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:28,520
I came to depend on him.

35
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,960
So good that...

36
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,520
when he left...

37
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,200
I almost

38
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:41,800
stopped breathing.

39
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,040
Song Yi.

40
00:03:19,920 --> 00:03:22,080
You finally came back.

41
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:02,520
I'm sorry.

42
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,280
It's enough that you're back.

43
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:27,320
Mm.

44
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,040
I'm back.

45
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,520
Song Yi.

46
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:44,760
Mm.

47
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,680
So that's how ugly you look.

48
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:01,560
Is this what you imagined?

49
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,480
No.

50
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,320
In my imagination

51
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,360
you were a guide dog.

52
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,200
Then I'll be your guide dog forever.

53
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,240
Okay.

54
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,520
Mm.

55
00:05:21,760 --> 00:05:23,360
No taking it back.

56
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,920
Sometimes?

57
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,400
No sometimes.

58
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,680
Fine.

59
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:37,160
No sometimes.

60
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,360
Mm.

61
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,160
Mom.

62
00:06:44,880 --> 00:06:45,880
Auntie Xu.

63
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:51,480
Mm.

64
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,800
Sit down.

65
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:53,880
Yes, yes.

66
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,000
Come sit down.

67
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,720
Sit.

68
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,879
It's been ages since we got together

69
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:03,840
so this is perfect;

70
00:07:03,841 --> 00:07:06,080
I thought I'd treat everyone to dinner.

71
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,440
Feiyu

72
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:09,960
don't sit there scowling.

73
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:12,320
You haven't seen Sister Yun in nine months.

74
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:13,960
So you go first

75
00:07:14,080 --> 00:07:15,279
toast Sister Yun

76
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,280
and apologize.

77
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:16,920
No need.

78
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:17,920
I...

79
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:20,560
Feiyu.

80
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:22,960
No matter where you hide

81
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:25,400
you're still my most beloved son.

82
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,480
Mm.

83
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,360
Auntie Xu.

84
00:07:36,866 --> 00:07:38,306
Before we eat...

85
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,239
I want to make everything clear.

86
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,600
Can it wait till after dinner?

87
00:07:42,857 --> 00:07:45,440
The food's getting cold.
Hold your horses, let's eat first.

88
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:46,560
Come on, eat.

89
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,560
Let him speak.

90
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,120
From today on.

91
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,200
I'm going to stay here.

92
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,680
Auntie Xu.

93
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,720
Is that all right?

94
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,360
All right.

95
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,480
Auntie Xu.

96
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,760
Thank you for accepting me.

97
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,440
Let me offer you a toast.

98
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:01,280
Mom... I...

99
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,400
My son.

100
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,280
No matter what you do.

101
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,280
Mom loves you.

102
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,840
All Mom wants is for you

103
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,880
to always be happy

104
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:23,880
and joyful.

105
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,440
Come on now

106
00:09:30,441 --> 00:09:32,280
I'll join in too.

107
00:10:57,920 --> 00:10:59,520
Didn't you quit smoking?

108
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,680
I did for a while.

109
00:11:03,279 --> 00:11:05,359
Then at an antique shop in Europe,

110
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:08,382
I saw another
lighter exactly like this one.

111
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,920
I couldn't resist lighting one.

112
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,560
So you took it up again?

113
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,240
Yeah.

114
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:25,120
Mm.

115
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,320
Every time I missed you.

116
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:41,326
That lighter just like
this one... did you buy it?

117
00:11:44,400 --> 00:11:45,400
No.

118
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,280
It looked like it

119
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,520
but it wasn't the one.

120
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,240
And besides.

121
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:59,120
I didn't dare to keep looking at it.

122
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:07,096
It made my chest hurt,
the guilt choking me...

123
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,120
Song Yi.

124
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,600
You came back

125
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:15,560
but all of this feels

126
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,880
so unreal.

127
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,320
It's real.

128
00:12:30,560 --> 00:12:32,000
All of this is real.

129
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:36,680
Mm.

130
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,320
Really feel it.

131
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:01,080
It's you.

132
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:02,920
It's you.

133
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:04,800
Song Yi.

134
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:07,200
It's really you...

135
00:13:07,760 --> 00:13:08,760
It's me.

136
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:11,840
It's really me.

137
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,720
Let me get a good look at you.

138
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:25,520
Mm.

139
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:52,920
Mm.
